Success Criteria

The demonstration allows an operator to:

Upload a real farm

Prepare the field

Configure agricultural zones

Plan a mission

Configure a heterogeneous fleet

Review the mission

Execute it

Observe live simulation

Replay the mission

Analyze metrics

Save the mission

Reload it

Repeat the process

without requiring any physical drone.

Demo Goal

An investor or customer should be able to understand the complete ORION operational workflow from beginning to end without imagining missing steps.

Every major operation should have a visible interface, a clear transition, and a consistent simulation backed by the Digital Twin.
